x86_64-windows  a destructible local and a `try` in one function is refused for this target, body or no body: a Microsoft cleanup is a funclet and a state in the FH3 tables rather than a row in a call-site list, so none of the splitting the Itanium path learned - the region emitted between the `try`s, and now the region emitted inside one carrying its catch types - has a counterpart there. `wrapMsCleanups` is untouched. Same lag rung 6.5 records for Windows exceptions generally, and the same reason local-beside-try carries this note.
